// MinGW builds only: windres does not get JUCE's MSVC "/MANIFESTDEPENDENCY" pragma, so embed the Common Controls
// v6 manifest by hand. 2 = ISOLATIONAWARE_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID (the ID a DLL's manifest needs), 24 = RT_MANIFEST.
2 24 "HorrorEngine.manifest"
